"feedback": {"neutral": "<p>Different answers to this question show different ways of seeing this. In order, from a first impression to the way of seeing the module aims at:</p><ol><li>Something went wrong&mdash;the wrong repository, or the commit is still on its way.</li><li>The commit has not been uploaded yet; you need to send it.</li><li>Your commit exists only in your own clone until you push it to the shared repository; the teammate's clone is a complete copy of the shared one as it was when they cloned, so they will see it after you push and they pull.</li></ol>"}
