The same file can differ in the working tree and in the index at
once---the three-places aspect (\cref{sec:staging}), and the hidden
dependency between an unadded edit and the index that professionals too
find hard to hold \autocite{Church2014HiddenDependencies}.
The [[git status]] output shows [[README.md]] as both staged and
unstaged; the key distractor denies that this is possible, the model of
a file as either saved or not.

