<<feedback: offline with a clone>>=
"feedback": {"neutral": "<p>A clone is a complete copy of the repository, history and all&mdash;that is what distributed means. git log works offline and shows the whole history up to the moment you cloned; nothing is fetched on demand, and your own commits are not the only ones there.</p>"}
